version-texts	Version texts	2026-11-09T14:35:07.7149502Z Tasks show up on the go: on a walk, at the checkout, while reading an email. Loose Ends captures them in a single sentence, without a form to fill in. The app then works out what is in your sentence and later shows you just what fits your situation right now.
version-texts	Version texts	2026-11-09T14:35:07.7151125Z 
version-texts	Version texts	2026-11-09T14:35:07.7151298Z CAPTURE IN ONE SENTENCE
version-texts	Version texts	2026-11-09T14:35:07.7152153Z • Type or dictate – in the app, on Apple Watch, with widgets, the Action button and Shortcuts
version-texts	Version texts	2026-11-09T14:35:07.7153279Z • Share sheet: turn text, links, emails, photos and files straight into a task
version-texts	Version texts	2026-11-09T14:35:07.7154387Z • Your original sentence is always kept unchanged
version-texts	Version texts	2026-11-09T14:35:07.7154801Z 
version-texts	Version texts	2026-11-09T14:35:07.7154973Z THE APP SORTS IT FOR YOU
version-texts	Version texts	2026-11-09T14:35:07.7155739Z • Due date, duration, importance and context are recognized from your sentence
version-texts	Version texts	2026-11-09T14:35:07.7156914Z • Fixed rules first, Apple Intelligence on your device only where language understanding is needed
version-texts	Version texts	2026-11-09T14:35:07.7158035Z • Learns from your choices: tag a sentence once, and it knows next time
version-texts	Version texts	2026-11-09T14:35:07.7158573Z 
version-texts	Version texts	2026-11-09T14:35:07.7158750Z YOU HAVE THE LAST WORD
version-texts	Version texts	2026-11-09T14:35:07.7159532Z • Every change is visible on the task
version-texts	Version texts	2026-11-09T14:35:07.7160112Z • Every field can be reset on its own
version-texts	Version texts	2026-11-09T14:35:07.7160461Z 
version-texts	Version texts	2026-11-09T14:35:07.7160653Z VIEWS THAT FIT THE MOMENT
version-texts	Version texts	2026-11-09T14:35:07.7161289Z • Now, New, Due, Quick, Old, Waiting, Parked, Completed
version-texts	Version texts	2026-11-09T14:35:07.7162015Z • By tag ("Garden", "Computer") and by project
version-texts	Version texts	2026-11-09T14:35:07.7162667Z • Repeating tasks and subtasks
version-texts	Version texts	2026-11-09T14:35:07.7162986Z 
version-texts	Version texts	2026-11-09T14:35:07.7163261Z REMINDS YOU AT THE RIGHT TIME – AND PLACE
